---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🧑‍🚀 Hello, Readers! !</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to the official  blog .
				I’m a technology enthusiast with a strong interest in learning, personal growth, 
				and understanding how people think and behave. I enjoy exploring different areas of technology 
				and keeping up with new ideas, tools, and innovations that can shape the future.


			</p>
			<p>
				Alongside technology, I have an interest in psychology 
				and enjoy learning about human behavior, mindset, and personal development. 
				My faith in God is an important part of who I am and helps guide my values and perspective in life.
			</p>
			<p>
				My goal is to build a meaningful and successful career in the technology field while continuously developing my skills and knowledge. 
				I believe in staying curious, learning from experiences, and growing both professionally and personally. 
				I’m excited about the journey ahead and hope to make a positive impact through my work and the things I learn along the way.</p>
			
			
			<p>
				Looking for a blog template with a bit more personality? Check out
				<a href="https://github.com/teablogs">teablogs/a>
				
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
